# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Declare dependencies {#declare-dependencies}"
msgstr "Ideklara ang mga dependency {#declare-dependencies}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A managed workflow runs in a Python environment that it prepares in advance. The job cannot reach the internet, so it cannot `pip install` packages. Instead, Qiskit and a list of [supported packages](#check-which-packages-are-installed) are already installed, and you can [upload wheels](#add-your-own-packages) for any other package that your workflow needs.\n"
msgstr "Tumatakbo ang isang managed workflow sa isang Python environment na inihahanda nito nang maaga. Hindi maaabot ng job ang internet, kaya hindi ito makakapag-`pip install` ng mga package. Sa halip, naka-install na ang Qiskit at isang listahan ng [mga sinusuportahang package](#check-which-packages-are-installed), at maaari kang [mag-upload ng mga wheel](#add-your-own-packages) para sa anumang ibang package na kailangan ng workflow mo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check which packages are installed {#check-which-packages-are-installed}"
msgstr "Tingnan kung aling mga package ang naka-install {#check-which-packages-are-installed}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every job runs with Python 3.12 on Linux (x86_64), with the following packages installed:\n"
msgstr "Tumatakbo ang bawat job gamit ang Python 3.12 sa Linux (x86_64), na may mga sumusunod na package na naka-install:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit`, `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, `qiskit-serverless`, and their dependencies, such as `numpy`.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit`, `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, `qiskit-serverless`, at ang mga dependency nila, gaya ng `numpy`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The supported packages, such as `qiskit-aer`, `qiskit-addon-sqd`, `qiskit-addon-utils`, `qiskit-mitigation`, `qiskit-addon-slc`, `qiskit-paulice`, `ffsim`, and `pyscf`. Each is installed at one fixed version.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga sinusuportahang package, gaya ng `qiskit-aer`, `qiskit-addon-sqd`, `qiskit-addon-utils`, `qiskit-mitigation`, `qiskit-addon-slc`, `qiskit-paulice`, `ffsim`, at `pyscf`. Bawat isa ay naka-install sa isang nakatakdang bersyon.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To see the supported packages and their versions, call `dependencies_versions()` from your local notebook:\n"
msgstr "Para makita ang mga sinusuportahang package at ang mga bersyon nila, tawagin ang `dependencies_versions()` mula sa local mong notebook:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* REVIEW: dependencies_versions() lists only requirements-dynamic-dependencies.txt. It omits qiskit, qiskit-ibm-runtime, qiskit-serverless, and numpy, although they are installed. */}\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"
msgstr ""
"{/* REVIEW: dependencies_versions() lists only requirements-dynamic-dependencies.txt. It omits qiskit, qiskit-ibm-runtime, qiskit-serverless, and numpy, although they are installed. */}\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your workflow can import any of these packages without setup. The workflow installs them when it builds the environment, not when a job starts, so they do not add to the start time of a job.\n"
msgstr "Maaaring mag-import ang workflow mo ng alinman sa mga package na ito nang walang setup. Ini-install ng workflow ang mga ito kapag binubuo ang environment, hindi kapag nagsisimula ang job, kaya hindi sila nagdaragdag sa oras ng pagsisimula ng job.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A workflow does not read a `requirements.txt` or `pyproject.toml` file, so it does not install the packages that these files list. The `dependencies` argument of `ManagedWorkflow` is deprecated and ignored, so it does not install packages either. Remove it from your upload code, and [upload wheels](#add-your-own-packages) instead.\n"
msgstr "Hindi bumabasa ang workflow ng `requirements.txt` o `pyproject.toml` na file, kaya hindi nito ini-install ang mga package na nakalista sa mga file na ito. Ang argument na `dependencies` ng `ManagedWorkflow` ay deprecated at binabalewala, kaya hindi rin ito nag-i-install ng mga package. Alisin ito sa upload code mo, at [mag-upload ng mga wheel](#add-your-own-packages) na lang.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
